{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1786752403706469270,"compiled_state":{"alias":"frolicky-dependable-peccary","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"3152f00975c4eccb580a86a56bcd6fff6f3cc170e295222658f410bfc5ee53a3","event_uuid":"ba99c606-5fc2-4c05-93dc-64ff4dc0ee10","position":{"commit_sha":"1fae3448bb3656d9da80bb3806fa7a4c238ac363","position":"1786750556759619001-ba99c606-5fc2-4c05-93dc-64ff4dc0ee10"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"cdafb3fa85d3840e2193a7f07cc009933048595cb8525c1f03e43cf4b91274b2","event_uuid":"eb0fbee3-ca6f-4db6-8d8b-c63fbbb69e18","position":{"commit_sha":"26d6f45c285cc5a27dedb087efd6dc1c227ac690","position":"1786750579903462001-eb0fbee3-ca6f-4db6-8d8b-c63fbbb69e18"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"62dfa944d6c8b2d8e1dc501d9e7bc63ee2c1a98490cdc078c9b5f507a8252f31","event_uuid":"0d76a9f7-8ec9-4b38-97c6-7d88a7b989f5","position":{"commit_sha":"b4fc4e97fdbfc5d6dfe05862df55067062e08066","position":"1786750594085908001-0d76a9f7-8ec9-4b38-97c6-7d88a7b989f5"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786750556759619001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"eb0fbee3-ca6f-4db6-8d8b-c63fbbb69e18","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"fd96-e6a0-8320-4f9b"},{"link_uuid":"0d76a9f7-8ec9-4b38-97c6-7d88a7b989f5","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"fc20-2df1-426e-42ab"}],"description":"## Symptom (live repro, 2026-08-14)\n`rebar transition clubby-circular-halicore open closed --class not_a_bug` on a bug whose RCA proved no defect ever existed FAILED: the close routed to the billable completion verifier, which synthesized the criterion \"bug is actually resolved: the reported defect no longer reproduces\" and marked it unmet — correctly noting \"no code change was made\" and \"the premise of the criterion (that a real defect existed and was resolved) is itself refuted by the RCA\". A truthful not_a_bug close is thus impossible without --force whenever there is no replacement ticket to link.\n\n## Mechanism\nclose_disposition.verdict() mints a deterministic disposition verdict only from find_replacement() (a live duplicates/supersedes link). not_a_bug is in DISPOSITION_CLASSES but inherently names no replacement, so verdict() returns None and the close falls through to full completion verification — which asks the wrong question for this class. The historical scoping comment (close_precheck.py ~:154) already recognizes \"not_a_bug asserts there is no defect\", but only exempted it from the duplicate-link REQUIREMENT, leaving it on the completion-verification path. escalated without a live replacement has the same fall-through shape (it \"may point outside the tracker\").\n\n## Fix (stacked on Gerrit 1794, ticket fc20 — reuse its machinery verbatim)\nMake not_a_bug a REASON-REQUIRED class exactly like obsolete/wontfix: add it to close_disposition.REASON_REQUIRED_CLASSES so (a) txn.close_class_refusal demands --reason=<text> (the RCA summary / pointer to the RCA comment), (b) verdict() mints the deterministic (class, close_reason) attestation with no replacement and no LLM, (c) decorate_manifest signs the disposition line, (d) the --reason-without---force admission in transition.py extends to it. Decide escalated deliberately: either reason-required the same way (reason = where it went), or keep replacement-preferred with reason fallback — document the choice. not_a_bug stays bug-only (NOT added to ADMINISTRATIVE_CLASSES non-bug vocabulary).\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] A bug close --class not_a_bug --reason \"<why no defect>\" (no --force, no replacement link) closes without invoking the billable completion verifier and mints a SIGNED disposition attestation carrying class+reason (store-event + manifest tests).\n- [ ] not_a_bug without --reason is refused at write time naming the requirement (gate-independent, txn.close_class_refusal test).\n- [ ] escalated's no-replacement path has an explicit, tested disposition (reason-required or documented fall-through — no silent completion-verifier routing).\n- [ ] 738a drift-guard and 1794's administrative-close suite stay green; docs (ticket-model.md, cli-reference) updated.\n- [ ] make lint / make typecheck clean; lands via Gerrit (LLM-Review +1, Verified +1).","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","fc20-2df1-426e-42ab"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"d54b-1c48-dc1c-49f5","ticket_type":"bug","title":"not_a_bug close without replacement routes to completion verifier, which demands proof a nonexistent defect was fixed","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["ba99c606-5fc2-4c05-93dc-64ff4dc0ee10","eb0fbee3-ca6f-4db6-8d8b-c63fbbb69e18","0d76a9f7-8ec9-4b38-97c6-7d88a7b989f5"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786752403706469270,"uuid":"cdb6ffd0-5daf-44b0-9a29-4604d64c9029"}